    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "therapists just want to talk about \"coping mechanisms\" or \"work-life balance\" which is a joke. it doesn't change the fact that the machine keeps turning and i'm just the fuel for it. there is no \"path forward\" that doesn't involve more of this. i just want the noise to stop. i want everything to just... cease. for real. like, imagine just waking up and not having to exist in this cycle anymore.",
